        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bizarre, Fortean Times\n- Companies: Dennis Publishing, John Brown Publishing, I Feel Good Publishing\n- Concepts: anomalous phenomena, Charles Fort\n\nFacts:\n- Bizarre was a British alternative magazine published from 1997 to 2015.\n- From 1991 to 2001, John Brown Publishing published Fortean Times.\n- From 2001 to 2005, I Feel Good Publishing published Fortean Times.\n- Dennis Publishing published Bizarre and Fortean Times.\n- Bizarre was a sister publication to Fortean Times.\n- Fortean Times is a British monthly magazine devoted to anomalous phenomena popularised by Charles Fort.",
